<spec_alignment>

**Authoritative workflow** is in **`.cursor/rules/lupfr-context-engineering.mdc`** (`alwaysApply: true`). For TypeScript and TSX, also use **`.cursor/rules/lupfr-code-to-docs-map.mdc`** to pick the right `docs/*.md` before you edit.

- If you **change** `proxy.ts` blocked paths, status, or public URL behavior, update **`docs/OVERVIEW.md`**, **`docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`**, and **`docs/TESTING.md`** (and `scripts/verify-routes.sh` when assertions change) in the same change.
- **YAML**, generated JSON, and API validation must stay consistent with **`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`** and **`docs/API.md`**.

</spec_alignment>
